    "original_gold_lex_dicts": {
        "Id1": {
            "text": "The Agremiacao Sportiva Arapiraquense club has 17000 members and they play in the Campeonato Brasileiro S\u00e9rie C league based in Brazil. Their ground is the Estadio Municipal Coaracy da Mata Fonseca located in Arapiraca and Vila Nova Futebol Clube are the champions of the league. The chairman of Agremia\u00e7\u00e3o Sportiva Arapiraquense has the title of 'President'."
